                    "fillColor": "#a3adbd",
                    "fillOpacity": 1
                  }
                ],
                "fontFamily": "Arimo",
                "text": "New loop gains one choice, Start with: Empty tracks (the default, today's New loop) or Ed's setup. It is the only place a loop starts, it already asks, and it saves the current session to the Library before anything changes, so a template here cannot overwrite work. The Looper X has no template feature (a loop starts from New Loop or from a saved loop) and the RC-600 starts from one of its memories; both make the starting point a choice at the start of a loop, not a separate page."
              }
            ],
            "textTransform": "none",
            "textAlign": "left",
            "fontId": "custom-99a2c890-1804-450c-8af8-6b60ee9a6b27",
            "fontSize": "28",
            "fontWeight": "400",
            "textDirection": "ltr",
